        "domain": ["home_score", "away_score"],
        "range": ["#1f77b4", "#ff7f0e"]
      },
      "legend": null
    }
  },
  "title": {
    "text": "Average Goals: Home Team vs Away Team",
    "subtitle": "Home teams typically score more goals on average."
  }
}
```

---

### 说明

- `fold`把`home_score`和`away_score`变成两行，字段名分别是`team_type`和`score`  
- 对`score`字段求平均，按`team_type`分组  
- 条形图横轴显示主客队，纵轴显示平均进球数  
- 用`title.subtitle`简短说明主队是否更占优势

